      "hardness": 0,
      "stealth": {
        "value": 13,
        "details": "<ul>\n<li>@Check[type:perception|dc:23|name:To Notice Dagger That&nbsp; Was Not There Before|traits:complex,haunt] (trained) To Notice Dagger That&nbsp; Was Not There Before.</li>\n</ul>"
      },
      "emitsSound": "encounter",
      "hasHealth": true
    },
    "details": {
      "isComplex": true,
      "level": {
        "value": 3
      },
      "disable": "<ul>\n<li>@Check[type:occultism|dc:20|name:To Banish Haunt|traits:complex,haunt] (expert) To Banish Haunt</li>\n<li>@Check[type:religion|dc:20|name: To Banish Haunt|traits:complex,haunt] (expert) To Banish Haunt</li>\n</ul>",
      "description": "<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Overwhelmed with despair, you move to the desk, retrieve what appears to be a silver-handled dagger from it, and use it to cut your own throat. </p>\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Insane Haunt</strong>: This haunt affects only those haunted by Traver Foxglove after slowly driven to madness. This haunt affects impulive or untrustworthy characters. Is no creature in a group fits its description it may affect any creture in a group.</p>",
      "reset": "<p>The haunt automatically resets after 1 day until the supernatural fungus in B37 is dealt with, even if the haunt was previously disabled.</p>",
      "routine": "<p><strong style=\"text-align: justify;\">I Must End This&nbsp;</strong><span class=\"pf2-icon\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">R</span><span style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"text-align: justify;\">Trigger</strong><span style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;Haunted character moves within 5 feet of desk Character must make a @Check[type:will|dc:26|name:Suggestion|traits:mental,incapacitating,linguistic,necromancy,occult] save or pick up the dagger and be unable to leave the room as per the haunt's routine.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Routine:</strong>&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-align: justify;\">Using two actions, the possessed creature must make a (@Check[type:will|dc:22|basic:true] save) against [[/r (2d8+7)[piercing]]] damage. </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Failure:</strong> additional @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.lDVqvLKA6eF3Df60]{Persistent Bleed Damage}</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\"><strong style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\">Critical Failure</strong>:&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"text-align: justify; font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\">additional </span><span style=\"text-align: justify; font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\">@Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.lDVqvLKA6eF3Df60]{Persistent Bleed Damage 2}</span></p>\n<p><strong>Do Not Interfere!&nbsp;</strong><span class=\"pf2-icon\">F</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Trlgger</strong>&nbsp;Creature within possessed target's reach attempts to intervene. Make a strike against the interveneing creature. Unlike attack of opportunity, this carries its own mulipie ﬂack penalty separate from its normal strike.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>"
    },
